<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Colt Telecom at $18.10/ADS.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Colt Telecom at $18.10/ADS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Colt Telecom Group PLC</p>
<p>   Priced At			     $18.10/ADS</p>
<p>   Estimated Price		     $18.08/ADS</p>
<p>   Number of ordinary shares	 26.7 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Morgan Stanley &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: Of the total global offering of 26.7 million ordinary shares, 13.35 million shares were offered in the United States and Canada. Each American Depositary Share (ADS) represents four ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The offering was earlier expected to price in a range of $14.83 to $16.80 per ADS, according to a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
